Instantly grow a moss circle of radius [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] at your feet.

Each turn the moss deals [23, 31, 37, 42, 46 (TL1-5; MP 100)] nature damage to each foe within its radius.

This moss is very slippery and causes affected foes to have a [17%, 23%, 27%, 30%, 32% (TL1-5)] chance of failing to perform complex actions.

The moss lasts [3, 5, 7, 8, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

Moss talents are instant but place all other moss talents on cooldown for 3 turns.

The damage and the chance to apply the slippery effect increase with your Mindpower.
